				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p>On closing days (except Mondays), it is possible to visit Beseno Castle, Stenico Castle, and Thun Castle upon advance payment via bank transfer. Please note that, for organisational reasons, a written request must be sent to the dedicated <a href="mailto:booking@buonconsiglio.it"><strong>email address</strong> </a>or&nbsp; by calling + 39 0461-492811 (from Monday to Friday, 9 a.m. &ndash; 1.p.m.) at least 48 hours in advance.</p></div>
