				<h5 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Reductions</h5>
				<div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix">
<p>People aged from 15 to 26: 6,00 &euro;</p>
<p>Visitors over the age of 65: 8,00 &euro;</p>
<p><a href="https://www.buonconsiglio.it/acquista/convenzioni/">Members and cardholders</a></p>
</div></div>
