<div class="et_pb_module et_pb_divider et_pb_divider_5 et_pb_divider_position_ et_pb_space"><div class="et_pb_divider_internal"></div></div>
<div class="et_pb_module et_pb_toggle et_pb_toggle_3 et_pb_toggle_item  et_pb_toggle_close">
				
				
				
				
				<h5 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Torre Aquila</h5>
				<div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix">
<p><b>Limited places, reservation recommended</b></p>
<p><strong>2,50 &euro; per person in addition to museum ticket.</strong></p>
<p>Admission to <a href="https://www.buonconsiglio.it/en/castello-del-buonconsiglio/buonconsiglio-il-castello/torre-aquila/"><strong>Torre Aquila</strong></a> is by timed ticket (every 45 minutes), accompanied by museum staff. To ensure safety, access is limited to around 20 people at a time. You can book your place and purchase your ticket online <strong><a href="https://www.midaticket.it/eventi/torre-aquila/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ticket online </a></strong>or, for groups or schools, reserve your tickets by calling +39 0461 492811.</p>
<p>You can download the audio guide to your smartphone before the visit.</p>
<p><b>Visiting hours</b></p>
<p>Winter &ndash; Museum Opening Hours: 9:30 am &ndash; 5:00 pm<br>10:15 &ndash; 11:00 &ndash; 11:45 &ndash; 12:30 &ndash; 1:15 pm &ndash; 2:00 pm &ndash; 2:45 pm &ndash; 3:30 pm &ndash; 4:15 pm</p>
<p>Summer &ndash; Museum Opening Hours: 10:00 am &ndash; 6:00 pm<br>10:30 am &ndash; 11:15 am &ndash; 12:00 pm &ndash; 12:45 pm &ndash; 1:30 pm &ndash; 2:15 pm &ndash; 3:00 pm &ndash; 3:45 pm &ndash; 4:30 pm &ndash; 5:15 pm</p>
</div></div>
			</div>
<div class="et_pb_module et_pb_divider et_pb_divider_6 et_pb_divider_position_ et_pb_space"><div class="et_pb_divider_internal"></div></div>
<div class="et_pb_module et_pb_toggle et_pb_toggle_4 et_pb_toggle_item  et_pb_toggle_close">
				
				
				
				
				<h5 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Families</h5>
				<div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix">
<p>Two adults with minors (up to 18 years): Pay only two full price tickets for the whole group: 20,00 &euro;</p>
<p>One adult with minors (up to 18 years): Pay only one full price ticket for the whole group 10,00 &euro;</p>
<p><strong>Free entry</strong> to Torre Aquila <strong>without the use of the audio guide</strong> for family members aged up to 14 years.</p>
<p>For holders of the&nbsp;<strong><a href="https://www.servizionline.provincia.tn.it/portale/sanit%C3%A0%2C__sociale_e_solidariet%C3%A0/1058/richiedi_la_tua_family_card/326100" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Family Card</a></strong>&nbsp;and the&nbsp;<strong><a href="https://fcard.trentinofamiglia.it/ServiziInclusi.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Euregio Family Pass</a></strong>: Reduced price tickets for the parent(s) accompanying one or more children under 18.</p>
</div></div>
			</div>
<div class="et_pb_module et_pb_divider et_pb_divider_7 et_pb_divider_position_ et_pb_space"><div class="et_pb_divider_internal"></div></div>
<div class="et_pb_module et_pb_toggle et_pb_toggle_5 et_pb_toggle_item  et_pb_toggle_close">
				
				
				
				
				<h5 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Groups</h5>
				<div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix">
<p>Groups of at least 15 visitors 8,00 &euro;</p>
<p>Free tickets not available</p>
<ul class="list-style ">
<li>groups can purchase tickets online, <strong>only if no invoice is required</strong>;</li>
<li>if an invoice is required, please fill in the form for the desired location (see below) and send it to <strong><a href="mailto:uff.amministrativo@castellodelbuonconsiglio.tn.it" target="_self" rel="noopener" data-wplink-edit="true">the dedicated email address </a></strong>at least 5 working days before the date of your visit, indicating the method of payment;</li>
<li>if access to Torre Aquila is also required during the visit, places must be booked by calling the museum&rsquo;s Educational Service;</li>
<li>the guided tour service is provided only upon verification of availability by contacting the museum&rsquo;s Educational Service.</li>
</ul>
