<ul>
<li>teachers accompanying school groups visiting the Museum, or otherwise accredited by the Museum (EDUCard);</li>
<li>people with disabilities and their carers;</li>
<li>professionals from the Heritage and Cultural sector (Ministry and Superintendence offices) and other affiliated bodies holding relevant proof of identity;</li>
<li>tour guides exercising their profession;</li>
<li>children up to 14 years of age*;</li>
<li>groups of students from schools of all levels, both state and private;</li>
<li>Italians resident abroad and enrolled in the registry office of Trentino municipalities (AIRE);</li>
<li>all visitors on the first Sunday of every month from October to March.</li>
</ul>
<p>* Proof of identity needed</p>
