				<h5 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Museum Pass &ndash; Trento, Rovereto And Surroundings</h5>
				<div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix">
<p>The&nbsp;<a href="https://www.visittrentino.info/it/esperienze/museum-pass" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Museum Pass</strong></a>&nbsp;costs 22,00 euros and is valid for 48 hours. It can be extended to three months at no additional cost, with access to museums, castles and places of interest in Trento, Rovereto and the surrounding area.</p>
<p>Free entry included in the Card.</p>
</div>
